WEBVTT

00:20:25.996 --> 00:20:30.038
The advice in business contexts is often
that we should learn to disregard

00:20:30.204 --> 00:20:33.204
and ignore the emotional,
fast acting system.

00:20:33.204 --> 00:20:36.621
One Instead, we should be logical, steady.

00:20:37.579 --> 00:20:41.746
The ultimate professional is supposed
to be stoic, but like Susan said,

00:20:41.746 --> 00:20:43.871
emotions are their own form of data.

00:20:44.121 --> 00:20:47.746
And when we ignore our emotions, we're
missing important data points.

00:20:48.663 --> 00:20:51.621
So how then should we bring
our emotions to work,

00:20:52.496 --> 00:20:56.996
the reality is we need both systems one
and two and we need to engage them.

00:20:57.496 --> 00:20:59.121
When your emotions are going haywire,

00:20:59.121 --> 00:21:02.954
you can use your logical system
to to choose to slow down,